 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Place objects and places",
   "texto": [
    "Prepositions are used to indicate a location: på («over; in»), under («below»), ved («next to»), mellom («between»), foran («before») and bak («behind»). I usually indicate that something is within a space.",
    "På may be equivalent to «en» even if there is no horizontal surface, as in på rommet («in the room»). The preposition does not always match word for word with Spanish.",
    "Står and ligger describe where something is; they do not always indicate that it is literally standing or lying. To talk about the location of a site is used ligger."
   ]
  },
